<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Below
is a chart summarizing the areas of each director&#8217;s expertise as a member of the board of directors:</span></p>

